  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ranger Protect Cover for our Wildlife Warriors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Zululand Conservation Trust partners with Manyoni Private Game Reserve to provide security to critical wildlife populations of South Africa.  We would like to register our 60 wildlife guardians with the Game Ranger Association of Africa to increase their access to gear, training, skills-improvement and added cover; and with their Ranger Protect programme for improved access to medical care, medical evacuation and coverage for death and disability. For as little as $4/a month, you can help!</narrative>
  </description>
